# Applies to the backend image's build context (repo root -- see backend/Dockerfile's comment
# on why). Only backend/ and tools/{bsdata-indexer,gdmissions}/output/ actually get COPYed;
# everything below just keeps the build context upload small and avoids ever baking in a real
# .venv or a stray real warhammer.db.
.venv/
.git/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.db
*.log
.idea/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
docs/
tools/bsdata-indexer/cache/
